      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T22:46:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See the commit message for what I think happened.\n\nBut basically:\n1) you guys changed aosp, but didn\u0027t update the tests at first.\n2) There was a failure when running CTS against aosp/main, becaues CTS is built off of android15-tests-dev and grew out of sync with the source on aosp/main\n3) You updated the test here, on android15-tests-dev, so CTS can pass on aosp/main\n4) Now, CTS-on-GSI fails, because, for all intents and purposes, the code here, on android15-tests-dev, is used to build GSI, which replaces the code ran on whatever image CTS-on-GSI is ran on. This is because GSI code does not match CTS tests.\n\nSo now..\n5) This change makes GSI code match the test here\n6) CTS continues to pass on aosp/main with a CTS APK built from here\n7) CTS-on-GSI should hopefully pass, now that the code used to build GSI will match the test too.",
      "parentUuid": "d134304a_d5c5ec65",
      "revId": "da3d8fb5f9ad702cc1ec64223e6f90460d352241",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
